{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Legend of Shiande",
    "steam_appid": 3384020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/12ea3d550c190d53e48dd9b64dabd49b.avif?t=1754400445\" width=640 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an RPG made to challenge your mind and push you completely out of your comfort zone. Here, everything is a test. Logic, strategy, patience, decision-making, and much more. If you're a fan of tough challenges, you're in the right place. But if you're looking for something casual\u2026 this probably isn't for you. There\u2019s no &quot;easy mode&quot; here. Just determination and a whole lot of &quot;Game Over&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helpful Tips:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/4e0bebd18f2c53eab82dfff200bf9cef.avif?t=1754400445\" width=114 height=80 /></span><strong>Thinking Monsters:</strong> Enemies have AI levels from 1 to 5. Smarter enemies will actually think \u2014 hitting your weakest ally, using deadly combos, and bosses with insane tactics. Some fights may feel like chess matches that take hours to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/6e5001e653152168cdbebd00fb49983f.avif?t=1754400445\" width=171 height=174 /></span><strong>Bestiary:</strong> Here you can catalog all the monsters in the game. Each one has unlock levels: Lv1, Lv2, Lv3, and Lv4. You\u2019ll need to complete side quests to raise their level. The higher the level, the more info you'll unlock. Reaching Lv4 gives you a special reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/df11145cdebed0534fecb31ed0122e87.webp?t=1754400445\" width=52 height=51 /></span><strong>No Potions or Revives in Shops:</strong> You won\u2019t find healing items in stores. The only way to get them is by exploring and finding them on the maps. Use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/a1714cc70b0cd5e323500661f0735f49.avif?t=1754400445\" width=70 height=92 /></span><strong>Save System:</strong> To save your progress, you\u2019ll need to find a crystal. The first time you touch one, it saves your game and fully heals your party. But be careful it only heals once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/5d6945b2c06bc224f7887ea4724a2e12.webp?t=1754400445\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Hidden Crystals:</strong> There are 19 crystals hidden throughout the game. You can trade them for bonuses like max HP upgrades, money, and even a super rare item: the Save Menu. Find all 19, and something REALLY cool will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/cc362f6fc50a0889388ac0383017218b.avif?t=1754400445\" width=65 height=65 /></span><strong>Save Menu:</strong> This item lets you save anytime, anywhere. Use it carefully \u2014 it\u2019s extremely rare. In tough puzzles or far from the last crystal, this could save your life. Save it for big moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/3b701aca28d8446a873a73ba4fd579c9.avif?t=1754400445\" width=80 height=80 /></span><strong>Don't Try to Beat It All at Once:</strong> Trying to finish the game in one go can be exhausting. I recommend playing one chapter at a time, enjoying the puzzles and challenges without burning out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/8cfc35039af53e85bfc9ab8cca3a6a55.avif?t=1754400445\" width=640 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>Legend of Shiande</strong></i> tells the story of a humble blacksmith from a quiet village surrounded by deep forests. One day, strange things begin to happen \u2014 people and animals start turning into vicious monsters, destroying everything in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the face of this threat, an ancient and powerful wizard chooses Shiande for an impossible mission: to save the world from an unstoppable curse. With only his courage, a hammer, and a strong will to protect what remains, Shiande sets off on a journey that may one day be told as a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legend of Shiande! (That is\u2026 if you can finish it.)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/12ea3d550c190d53e48dd9b64dabd49b.avif?t=1754400445\" width=640 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an RPG made to challenge your mind and push you completely out of your comfort zone. Here, everything is a test. Logic, strategy, patience, decision-making, and much more. If you're a fan of tough challenges, you're in the right place. But if you're looking for something casual\u2026 this probably isn't for you. There\u2019s no &quot;easy mode&quot; here. Just determination and a whole lot of &quot;Game Over&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helpful Tips:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/4e0bebd18f2c53eab82dfff200bf9cef.avif?t=1754400445\" width=114 height=80 /></span><strong>Thinking Monsters:</strong> Enemies have AI levels from 1 to 5. Smarter enemies will actually think \u2014 hitting your weakest ally, using deadly combos, and bosses with insane tactics. Some fights may feel like chess matches that take hours to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/6e5001e653152168cdbebd00fb49983f.avif?t=1754400445\" width=171 height=174 /></span><strong>Bestiary:</strong> Here you can catalog all the monsters in the game. Each one has unlock levels: Lv1, Lv2, Lv3, and Lv4. You\u2019ll need to complete side quests to raise their level. The higher the level, the more info you'll unlock. Reaching Lv4 gives you a special reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/df11145cdebed0534fecb31ed0122e87.webp?t=1754400445\" width=52 height=51 /></span><strong>No Potions or Revives in Shops:</strong> You won\u2019t find healing items in stores. The only way to get them is by exploring and finding them on the maps. Use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/a1714cc70b0cd5e323500661f0735f49.avif?t=1754400445\" width=70 height=92 /></span><strong>Save System:</strong> To save your progress, you\u2019ll need to find a crystal. The first time you touch one, it saves your game and fully heals your party. But be careful it only heals once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/5d6945b2c06bc224f7887ea4724a2e12.webp?t=1754400445\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Hidden Crystals:</strong> There are 19 crystals hidden throughout the game. You can trade them for bonuses like max HP upgrades, money, and even a super rare item: the Save Menu. Find all 19, and something REALLY cool will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/cc362f6fc50a0889388ac0383017218b.avif?t=1754400445\" width=65 height=65 /></span><strong>Save Menu:</strong> This item lets you save anytime, anywhere. Use it carefully \u2014 it\u2019s extremely rare. In tough puzzles or far from the last crystal, this could save your life. Save it for big moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/3b701aca28d8446a873a73ba4fd579c9.avif?t=1754400445\" width=80 height=80 /></span><strong>Don't Try to Beat It All at Once:</strong> Trying to finish the game in one go can be exhausting. I recommend playing one chapter at a time, enjoying the puzzles and challenges without burning out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384020/extras/8cfc35039af53e85bfc9ab8cca3a6a55.avif?t=1754400445\" width=640 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>Legend of Shiande</strong></i> tells the story of a humble blacksmith from a quiet village surrounded by deep forests. One day, strange things begin to happen \u2014 people and animals start turning into vicious monsters, destroying everything in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the face of this threat, an ancient and powerful wizard chooses Shiande for an impossible mission: to save the world from an unstoppable curse. With only his courage, a hammer, and a strong will to protect what remains, Shiande sets off on a journey that may one day be told as a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legend of Shiande! (That is\u2026 if you can finish it.)</p>",
